# src/apps/daemon/internal/networking/relay

## Purpose
Implements daemon-side relay transport integration for forwarding traffic through configured relay endpoints.

## Contents
Contains Go relay connection, framing/configuration, and lifecycle helpers used by networking orchestration.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Called by higher transport/routing layers and depends on socket/protocol primitives plus validated relay configuration.

## Invariants
Relay endpoints and peer data are validated, cancellation and deadlines bound network activity, partial I/O is handled explicitly, and failed or closed sessions release owned connections and goroutines.